        "widgetNotes": {
          "equipment": {
            "root": {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "detail": 0,
                      "format": 1,
                      "mode": "normal",
                      "style": "",
                      "text": "Not Critting? ",
                      "type": "text",
                      "version": 1
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "linebreak",
                      "version": 1
                    },
                    {
                      "detail": 0,
                      "format": 0,
                      "mode": "normal",
                      "style": "",
                      "text": "Make sure you don't have resource reduction anywhere in your gear or tree. If your fury cost drops below 30 you'll only crit half the time. The higher it costs the better, provided you can stay above 100 Fury.",
                      "type": "text",
                      "version": 1
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "linebreak",
                      "version": 1
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "linebreak",
                      "version": 1
                    },
                    {
                      "detail": 0,
                      "format": 1,
                      "mode": "normal",
                      "style": "",
                      "text": "Resource Issues?",
                      "type": "text",
                      "version": 1
                    }
                  ],
                  "direction": "ltr",
                  "format": "",
                  "indent": 0,
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "version": 1
                },
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "detail": 0,
                      "format": 0,
                      "mode": "normal",
                      "style": "",
                      "text": "Fury is not a problem much in this setup. Resource generation may be necessary as affixes on ring(s) or Fury Generation on a few defensives if you notice you can't easily stay above 100 Fury. Insight with a GA on it fixes this but without that, you'll need a couple affixes on armor pieces or jewelry.",
                      "type": "text",
                      "version": 1
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "linebreak",
                      "version": 1
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "linebreak",
                      "version": 1
                    },
                    {
                      "detail": 0,
                      "format": 1,
                      "mode": "normal",
                      "style": "",
                      "text": "Alternative Options",
                      "type": "text",
                      "version": 1
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "linebreak",
                      "version": 1
                    },
                    {
                      "detail": 0,
                      "format": 0,
                      "mode": "normal",
                      "style": "",
                      "text": "Consider swapping to max resource rolls where possible and Rmanaldi's Sword (instead of Strengt). Could further go fully into resource and go \"immortal\" with a selig's amulet. In that case you'd want to remove every bit of max life increase.",
                      "type": "text",
                      "version": 1
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "linebreak",
                      "version": 1
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "linebreak",
                      "version": 1
                    },
                    {
                      "detail": 0,
                      "format": 0,
                      "mode": "normal",
                      "style": "",
                      "text": "Overkill Mace will be outclassed by a good Infinity as you push higher pits.",
                      "type": "text",
                      "version": 1
                    }
                  ],
